<title>FRANCE: Clarins 1996 net attrib up 17.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Clarins 1996 net attrib up 17.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>   Net attributable			241.2  vs 205.2</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		7.20</p>
<p>    Operating				430.6  vs 364.7</p>
<p>    Turnover			     2,965.3  vs 2,560.8</p>
<p>NOTE - French cosmetics group Clarins released its results in a statement. It said the net dividend of 7.20 francs was up 15.8 percent, taking into account the distribution of one free share for every eight in September 1996.</p>
<p>Clarins said sales in the first quarter of 1997 rose 12.7 percent compared with the same period a year earlier. On a like-for-like basis, sales were up 8.9 percent. Clarins forecast an increase in sales in 1997 of close to 10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
